# w46 §C (X2), variant two. Same shape as `w46-c-blocker-idle.state` — seat 0
# (human, the ATTACKER)'s own uncontested Main Phase 1, one untapped, non-sick
# creature and nothing pre-declared, so Forge's own LIVE `InputAttack` opens
# for real — but seat 1 (ai, the DEFENDER) ALSO holds Lightning Bolt ({R},
# "deals 3 damage to any target") and one untapped Mountain, on top of its
# untapped, non-sick blocker. So the defender's actionable set during the
# post-declaration priority round of Declare Attackers Step is NOT empty:
# there is a real instant they could cast before blocks are even assigned
# (the paper-Magic response window to an attack declaration).
turn=1
activeplayer=human
activephase=MAIN1
humanlife=20
ailife=20
humanhand=
humanbattlefield=Memnite
humanlibrary=Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain
humangraveyard=
aihand=Lightning Bolt
aibattlefield=Memnite;Mountain
ailibrary=Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain
aigraveyard=
